SQL - structuredquery language.

use - it is used for selecting schema
create - to create the table
  create table table_name(column_name data_type )
insert - it is used for to insert the values
  insert into table_name values(values) or insert into table_name (column_name) values(values)
alter - to alter the column.
  alter table table_name add column column_name data_type
  alter table table_name rename column column_name to New_column_name
  alter table table_name modify column column_name data_type
  alter table table_name drop column column_name
delete - it is used to delete the row
  delete from table_name where column_name = values
update - t is used forupdate the values.
  update table_name set column_name = value where column_name = values
Forign key :Forign key is primary key of another table. this is the reference of another table. to avoid repeating data and use less momory

String Operation:
Concat - used to join 2 string
Concate_WS -  used to join with seperator
Upper - to use convert upper case
lower - to use convert lower case
trim - used to trim extra space front and end of string not middle.
ltrim - used to trm left side spaces
lpad - used to add some text or number left side on column values
rpad - used to add some text or number right side on column values
Find_in_set - it is used to fnd exact word n whch positon comma seperatted at the finding first position.
length - it s used to find string length
substring - it used to find the character in partcular position
          select first_name, substring(first_name, 1,3) from table_name
          select first_name, substring(first_name, -2) from table_name (last two letter of string)
            select first_name, left(first_name, 2) from table_name (first 2 letter of string)
